// Final detection — as run in the lab (matches screenshot 13). The >30m
// threshold was settled after >1h returned nothing overnight: real delays sat
// under an hour. Returned 4 bus lines over threshold; the top two (74, 11)
// were confirmed by the case as the actual no-shows.
// Source: BusTelemetry (Eventhouse: DetectiveAgency, live Eventstream)

BusTelemetry
| extend Delay = Timestamp - ScheduleTime
| summarize MaxDelay = max(Delay) by BusLine
| where MaxDelay > 30m
| top 5 by MaxDelay desc
